      "lineNbr": 554,
      "author": {
        "id": 1903985
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-09-30T19:03:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes your observation regarding ninja file creation not needing to reoccur for legacy is correct.\nAnd yes with this CL a symlink for AndroidManifest.xml will not appear in the synthetic workspace so bp2build will not trigger and the ninja target that relies on it won\u0027t succeed.\n\nMeasuremnt for the two I should be able to find out quickly (i.e. TODAY).\nBreakdown of the two reponsibilities into two ninja targets - I\u0027ll need to think a bit more (but contingent on the timing observations that justify the change as well)",
      "parentUuid": "e4abb574_02b4d445",
      "revId": "2b295d5a44711bc3f22632ab7c9ca434f01360ee",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8fbd164d_8417fdb8",
        "filename": "cmd/soong_build/main.go",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 554,
