      "writtenOn": "2022-10-05T18:09:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Here\u0027s a much better CUJ that this CL will break:\n1. Add a `missing.cpp` file in an Android.bp but forget to actually have that cpp file.\n2. Run `m missing --bazel-mode` (where \"missing\" is the soong module that added missing.cpp to its `srcs` attribute)\n3. (Maybe the build failed) but you realize you hadn\u0027t created missing.cpp and do so now\n4. rerun `m missing --bazel-mode` but missing.cpp will still not appear in your symlink forest\n\nGIVEN THIS Example, I am aborting this CL",
